Name: libc
License File: LICENSE-APACHE
License File: LICENSE-MIT
Description: Raw FFI bindings to platform system libraries.

* What is this crate used for?
Raw FFI bindings to platform system libraries for Rust code.

* Are there any use restrictions? i.e. only for development hosts
No.

* What differs from upstream? Include a changelog if feasible.
This includes https://github.com/rust-lang/libc/pull/5338 to fix
a build failure on CQ/CI with RBE. When this pull request has been
merged upstream and rolled in a future `libc` release, this
crate can be un-fork'ed.

* Are there any restrictions to how it should be rolled?
Keep patching in https://github.com/rust-lang/libc/pull/5338 until
merged upstream.

* Is there anything else which makes this dependency "special"?
No.
